bring _foreign.tung
bring class/algebra/total/hath_multiply.tung
bring type/natural.tung
bring type/one.tung

## a non-normalised span measured in milliseconds.
show type _milliseconds: * { milliseconds: [ℕ, _milliseconds] }

show let seconds: [a: ℕ, _milliseconds] ≔ a · 1000 $ milliseconds

show let minutes: [a: ℕ, _milliseconds] ≔ a · 60 $ seconds

show let hours: [a: ℕ, _milliseconds] ≔ a · 60 $ minutes

show let sleep_for: [(t milliseconds): _milliseconds, 𝟙 effect] ≔ t sleep
